'''Xenoshot''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] gun that was originally obtained from purchasing it individually from the Xenoshot Gamepass for 1,699 Robux or from the [[Xenotech Bundle]] for 3,399 Robux during the [[Halloween Event 2025|2025 Halloween Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has ended.

== Appearance ==
The barrel is primarily purple with black details sprawling across. The rest of the gun is mainly black, with purple details on the handle.

== Trivia ==
* It pairs with the godly knife [[Xenoknife]], making the [[Murder Mystery 2 Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Xeno Set|Xeno Set]].
* This gun alongside its knife and effect counterparts were originally red before being changed to purple shortly after.

